OL,3,GNEWSAArboretum changes name under
OL,4,Aplanned rebrand
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe National Memorial Arboretum will
OL,7,Fbegin operating under a new name on
OL,8,FWednesday, following a planned
OL,9,Frebranding.
OL,11,FThe arboretum in Alrewas,
OL,12,FStaffordshire, announced earlier this
OL,13,Fyear that the 150-acre (61-hectare)
OL,14,Festate would be renamed the Royal
OL,15,FBritish Legion National Remembrance
OL,16,FGardens, following its full integration
OL,17,Finto the RBL, its parent charity.
OL,19,FThe move provoked a backlash among
OL,20,Fvisitors and some veterans, prompting a
OL,21,Fpetition signed by about 25,000 people.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
